---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="About" description="About Aditya Verma.">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      I'm Aditya Verma. I build developer tools and AI agents, and I care most
      about the boring parts: fast startup, clear output, and failing loudly
      when something is wrong.
    </p>
    <p>
      Most of what I ship is small. A menu bar app, a CLI, a script that
      became a CLI. I like tools that do one thing and get out of the way, for
      people and for agents alike.
    </p>
    <h2>What I work with</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Swift for macOS apps</li>
      <li>Rust for CLIs that need to be fast and safe</li>
      <li>TypeScript for anything that touches the web or git</li>
      <li>Python for data, scripts and LLM tooling</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>
